WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.211
Today is a short check, and then a game.

2
00:00:02.661 --> 00:00:07.207
Your child reads eight words to you. The last two are new. They have never seen them.

3
00:00:07.657 --> 00:00:11.148
Tick each word they read, however slowly. Slow is fine.

4
00:00:11.598 --> 00:00:13.042
Do not help on this page.

5
00:00:13.742 --> 00:00:14.892
Then count the ticks.

6
00:00:15.342 --> 00:00:17.287
Six or more, go on to day six.

7
00:00:17.737 --> 00:00:23.040
Fewer than six, do days three and four again, then come back to this page. That is normal.

8
00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:29.581
Then play the game on the next page. Your child reads a word, then colors it, all the way to the end.
